OL,3,GNEWSABelfast to get first Ulster Scots
OL,4,Astreet sign since rule change
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn agreement to install Belfast's first
OL,7,FUlster-Scots bilingual street sign
OL,8,Fsince the council changed its rules
OL,9,Ffour years ago, shows the community is
OL,10,F"beginning to engage with the language
OL,11,Fagain," the Ulster-Scots commissioner
OL,12,Fhas said.
OL,14,FLee Reynolds said the sign, which will
OL,15,Fbe installed at Ravenscroft Avenue in
OL,16,Fthe east of the city, is a positive
OL,17,Fstep.
OL,19,FBelfast City Council has approved
OL,20,Fhundreds of dual language streets since
OL,21,F1998 but the vast majority of them are
OL,22,Fin English and Irish only.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
